WEBVTT

00:08:26.583 --> 00:08:30.417
who use over-the-air
TV reception to an antenna.

00:08:31.292 --> 00:08:32.893
Per Nielsen data,

00:08:32.917 --> 00:08:37.768
these homes constitute
15 percent of US households,

00:08:37.792 --> 00:08:40.518
which is about 45 million people.

00:08:40.542 --> 00:08:45.226
Commitment and focus on quality
means we made every effort

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.809
to collect information

00:08:46.833 --> 00:08:51.434
from these 15 percent,
hard-to-reach groups.

00:08:51.458 --> 00:08:52.917
Why does it matter?

00:08:53.875 --> 00:08:55.184
This is a sizeable group

00:08:55.208 --> 00:08:58.518
that's very, very important
to the marketers, brands,

00:08:58.542 --> 00:09:01.143
as well as the media companies.